flowchart TD
    Client[Main client] --> Facade[PassengerRegistrationFacade<br/>registerPassenger]
    Facade --> Docs[DocumentChecker<br/>Check passenger name and document]
    Docs -->|valid| Seat[CabinPlacementService<br/>Assign seat]
    Docs -->|invalid| StopDocs[Cancel registration]
    Seat -->|available| Bag[BaggageAcceptanceService<br/>Accept baggage]
    Seat -->|already reserved| StopSeat[Cancel registration]
    Bag --> Pass[BoardingPassPrinter<br/>Print boarding pass]
    Pass --> Border[BorderServiceNotifier<br/>Notify border service]
    Border --> Done[Registration complete]
    Facade -. optional reprint .-> Pass
